### File di richieste HTTP: in Visual Studio / VS Code (estensione "REST Client")
### clicca "Send Request" sopra ogni richiesta per provarla.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Tutti i progetti (con conteggio task)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### Crea un progetto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Thesis"
}

### Tutti i task di un progetto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?projectId=1

### Solo i task "InProgress"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=InProgress

### Un task specifico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Task inesistente -> 404 ProblemDetails (GlobalExceptionHandler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/9999

### Crea un task -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review LINQ",
  "description": "Where, Select, Include, GroupBy",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z",
  "projectId": 1
}

### Task non valido (titolo vuoto) -> 400 automatico di [ApiController]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "Low",
  "projectId": 1
}

### Aggiorna tutto il task (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Study DI lifetimes (updated)",
  "description": null,
  "status": "Done",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": null
}

### Sposta un task di colonna (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### Elimina un task -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3
